@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folder_items/{folder_item_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER_ITEM + 连接容器" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "类型化文件投影任务" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE 文件元素
note right of API
  手动连接删除
  只有工作表投影才能自动更改会员
  来源: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; 在指定区域中删除元素
API -> OUT: 添加 folder_item.deleted
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 204 没有答案
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid, scope=user-folder)
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: 阅读其余的 normalized items + ready counts
group 一个 worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: replace snapshot + counts + version/updated_at
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder_item.deleted {uuid} + effect guard
end
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: folder_item.deleted
@enduml
